{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依都市更新條例（以下簡稱本條例）第七十六條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"D0070026/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"3c4bc1e74d71db638d53913fd82a2bae30b53c7c034b2fac63fbfe8f5b3c3d65","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":33,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關依本條例第七十六條第二項強制接管時，得編列預算或運用都市更新基金依本辦法辦理。","id":"D0070026/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"47b967972784954a0d183055b05f8c57fab711a6abdc83fe8c694af640405a1e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":51,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關為執行接管任務，應組成接管小組。\n前項接管小組得委聘具有專門學識經驗之人員協助處理有關事項。","id":"D0070026/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"ab17ec445d76f4c11b62b802a1593eb9eeff800c2229e451a3620cfc82fc3108","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":29,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:3/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":29,"end":58,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關為強制接管處分時，應公告下列事項，並以書面通知受接管處分之實施者（以下簡稱被接管人）、有關機關、土地與合法建築物所有權人、他項權利人、承租人、使用人、管理人及占有他人土地之舊違章建築戶：\n一、原核准之都市更新事業名稱。\n二、被接管人名稱、主事務所所在地、代表人姓名及其住所或居所。\n三、撤銷更新核准之理由及依據。\n四、接管日。\n五、接管小組之權限。\n六、被接管人應配合事項。\n七、其他事項。\n前項公告之日期及地點應刊登當地政府公報或新聞紙三日，並張貼於直轄市、縣（市）政府、鄉（鎮、市、區）公所及當地村（里）辦公處之公告牌。公告期間不得少於三十日。","id":"D0070026/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"eaaef27b6d006aa71558b26bc11ebd53f6a9f4235bac6d4ff1efcfd0a26868dc","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":208,"children":[{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":106,"end":122,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":122,"end":153,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":153,"end":169,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":169,"end":176,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":176,"end":187,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":187,"end":200,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":200,"end":208,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070026/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":208,"end":286,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"都市更新事業經接管後，其財產由接管小組管理、處分。","id":"D0070026/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"6ace85a2e408b17ea40294349601ee2c3e675cc1f699948a13ea6145cc7cf56c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":25,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"被接管人應自接管日起停止被接管都市更新事業之營運，並於七日內檢具舉辦都市更新事業相關之計畫、書、圖、文件、資產負債表、收支餘絀表、財產目錄、債權人與債務人清冊及其他必要文件，移交予接管小組。","id":"D0070026/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"e6921a3b4472c981093e93f0711cfd51be3c8e2cf8203b62adc941f6640aae2b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":95,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"被接管人因都市更新事業營運所產生之債權，其債務人應向接管小組清償；所產生之債務，其債權人應自接管日起三個月內向接管小組申報其債權，逾期未申報者，得不予清償。\n前項規定應由接管小組公告之，其公告方式準用第四條第二項規定辦理。對於已知債務人及債權人者並應以書面通知。","id":"D0070026/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"52dfeb086669e40072d6cdf54225c561106195953e9c489e903575fe55305e80","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":79,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:7/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":79,"end":131,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"接管小組於申報債權期限屆滿後，應即編造債權表，並將已收集或可收集屬於該都市更新事業計畫範圍內資產，編造資產表。\n前項債權表及資產表得供利害關係人閱覽。","id":"D0070026/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"4ed9730aeeea30e486fb5344c4765536b355412a8d3cd8410c8ce1ff93f3fe36","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":56,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:8/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":56,"end":75,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"接管小組應依前條編造之債權表及資產表辦理清理後，向各該直轄市、縣（市）主管機關提出報告，並召開說明會，向土地及合法建築物所有權人、他項權利人、承租人、使用人、管理人、占有他人土地之舊違章建築戶及被接管人說明。\n前項說明會應邀請各該直轄市、縣（市）主管機關或有關機關列席。","id":"D0070026/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"f86d8615f96472f5ac08b592ff6c983e9134fd277ef34e8969ee76e6925a38c0","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":105,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070026/a:9/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":105,"end":135,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關應於接獲接管小組報告後，按原核准之相關計畫自行接續實施，或依本條例第十二條及第二十二條規定委託都市更新事業機構、同意其他機關（構）自行實施或委託都市更新事業機構、核准都市更新會為實施者接續實施，並於完成移交後終止接管。但都市更新事業計畫範圍內土地及合法建築物所有權人，其人數與土地及合法建築物所有權比率，依實施地區性質，分別超過本條例第三十七條規定之比率，表示反對時，直轄市、縣（市）主管機關得撤銷原核准之相關計畫，終止接管並結束該都市更新事業。","id":"D0070026/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"b9f0d9e249e1c0be885b00ed3de9758f9ca43807c1e71713d9c31d070d97233e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":235,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"接管期間內接管資產之一切所得，應優先支付因接管所產生之費用。","id":"D0070026/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"90ef50213593652cb4a3957111d8b5e9210eb77cde995e1e524e9584007a5658","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":30,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"接管小組因接管所產生之費用，如可歸責於被接管人之事由者，其費用由被接管人負擔。","id":"D0070026/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"f7c7f54df8886c1e4124a6f526c23d6fbcf85f3fd379f408838350a3aea1b24d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":39,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"D0070026/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070026/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"都市更新與危老","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國八十八年三月三十一日內政部（88）台內營字第 8872656  號\n  令訂定發布全文 13 條\n2.中華民國一百零八年五月二十七日內政部台內營字第 1080808390 號令\n  修正發布第 1、2、10 條條文","id":"D0070026","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2019-05-27","name":"都市更新事業接管辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070026","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"ca2467b0ea1cf9be6cce5ea01e71839d8986242048c18e81f40251b127ab4098","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2019-05-27","effectiveDate":""}}